# Home to Northron by the frozen waterfall (Grignir's route): the crevice at its foot, through the Ice
# Flow and the Slate Cavern, then down the mountain. Mauragin follows, so the player walks to each cave
# door and takes it; a greeting on the way ends a walk, so the walk is taken up again.
case sohn_home
defend
walk 164391 76285 840
bye if open
walk 164391 76285 840
until 3000 "Mauragin01"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 0578DEC7
until 600 GetPCCell "Ice Flow" == 1
walk 3298 17989 -1408
bye if open
walk 3298 17989 -1408
until 3000 "Mauragin01"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 05DDBAB8
until 600 GetPCCell "Slate Cavern" == 1
walk 16224 3030 -1032
bye if open
walk 16224 3030 -1032
until 3000 "Mauragin01"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 05B23937
until 600 GetPCCell "Slate Cavern" == 0
# Down the mountain, a long way over several cells: legs at the descent's turns keep the walk off the
# side pockets of the slope.
walk 120864 51537 3974
bye if open
walk 120864 51537 3974
walk 96068 8603 1326
bye if open
walk 96068 8603 1326
walk 94960 8289 1116
bye if open
walk 94960 8289 1116
walk 95936 5759 168
bye if open
walk 95936 5759 168
walk 96650 4180 52
walk 97560 4122 43
walk 98304 4352 344
bye if open
walk 98304 4352 344
walk 119050 -5831 975
bye if open
walk 119050 -5831 975
bye if open
walk 119050 -5831 975
until 3000 "Mauragin01"->GetDistance player < 600
activate 05CFB21C
until 600 GetPCCell "Great Hall of Northron" == 1
talk ZwergenKonigOlim01
bye
expect Zwergenvar == 9
end
